    "summary": "Model eligibility — **BIG MEK**. A friendly unit with **ORKS WALKER** in the bearer’s 3\" radius gives it **[Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative)**. **BIG MEK** units cannot meet this condition. While that condition holds, you can choose a friendly unit with **ORKS WALKER** during your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase). It must be within the bearer’s 3\" radius. Attacks from the chosen unit can re-roll 1s on **[hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls)** until turn end.",
